WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.379
MAID Speech Evidence from Still-Sitting MPs.

00:00:03.329 --> 00:00:09.397
This page documents key Hansard debate speeches from the MAID C-14 and C-7 votes.

00:00:09.397 --> 00:00:15.022
Each speech is linked to the official parliamentary debate transcript on OpenParliament.ca.

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:19.931
Still-sitting MPs who spoke in favour of expanding state-sanctioned killing are flagged.

00:00:19.931 --> 00:00:23.681
Their own words, recorded in Hansard, are the evidence.

00:00:23.681 --> 00:00:28.818
In 1976, Canada abolished the death penalty for convicted murderers.

00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:37.068
In 2016 and 2021, these Members of Parliament voted to legalise the killing of the disabled, the elderly, and the mentally ill.
